  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon Streamlining of MOSA Proced. and Improve M&amp;E System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purposes of the IDF Grant are (i) to improve and streamline the procedures of the MOSA; (ii) evaluate the services covered throught the SDC and explore new institutional arrangements; and (iii) develop a monitoring and evaluation system to improve MOSA&apos;s capacity to follow up on  the beneficiaries of its programs and to assess social changes and impact on the poor at the local level.</narrative>
  </description>
